{"id":5,"type":"TextGenerate","pos":[55.49594639392569,-1066.6115155520524],"size":[530,244],"flags":{},"order":8,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":7},{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":8},{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"max_length","name":"max_length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_length"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sampling_mode","name":"sampling_mode","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"sampling_mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"thinking","name":"thinking","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"thinking"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"use_default_template","name":"use_default_template","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"use_default_template"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"generated_text","name":"generated_text","type":"STRING","links":[24,27]}],"title":"Stage 1 — forced anatomical prosecutor","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"TextGenerate","cnr_id":"comfy-core"},"widgets_values":["Act as an adversarial regional anatomy prosecutor for an AI-generated image. Your job is to propose three independent, concrete visual claims for later verification, not to decide whether the image passes. Attractive subjects, convincing lighting, explicit adult content, and scene plausibility are irrelevant.\n\nFirst decide whether human figures are present and count them. Trace visible anatomy to individual owners. Then nominate the most suspicious falsifiable feature in each region: (1) heads, necks and torsos; (2) shoulders, arms and hands; (3) hips, legs and feet. Look for missing or abruptly terminated parts, fused bodies, extra or detached parts, impossible joints, inconsistent scale and ambiguous ownership. A part disappearing inside the image is not frame cropping.\n\nYou must supply one candidate claim for each region even when the image appears correct; the verifier is expected to reject false suspicions. When a whole region genuinely leaves the outer frame, state that as the candidate rather than inventing an internal defect. Do not score the image and do not answer pass, perfect, or no defects.\n\nReturn exactly one semicolon-separated line:\nTARGET=HUMAN; PEOPLE=0; HEAD_TORSO_CLAIM=specific local claim; ARMS_HANDS_CLAIM=specific local claim; LEGS_FEET_CLAIM=specific local claim; EVIDENCE=brief visible basis for the three claims\n\nFor an image without people return TARGET=NONHUMAN; PEOPLE=0; HEAD_TORSO_CLAIM=not applicable; ARMS_HANDS_CLAIM=not applicable; LEGS_FEET_CLAIM=not applicable; EVIDENCE=no human figures. Replace every example value appropriately. Output no analysis, markdown, policy discussion, scores, or additional lines.",512,"off",0.1,1]},{"id":21,"type":"TextGenerate","pos":[1200,-580],"size":[530,244],"flags":{},"order":9,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":28},{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":29},{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"max_length","name":"max_length","type":"INT","widget":{"name":"max_length"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"sampling_mode","name":"sampling_mode","type":"COMFY_DYNAMICCOMBO_V3","widget":{"name":"sampling_mode"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"thinking","name":"thinking","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"thinking"},"link":null},{"localized_name":"use_default_template","name":"use_default_template","shape":7,"type":"BOOLEAN","widget":{"name":"use_default_template"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"generated_text","name":"generated_text","type":"STRING","links":[30]}],"title":"Neutral appeal assessment","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"TextGenerate","cnr_id":"comfy-core"},"widgets_values":["Act as a neutral visual-quality assessor. Judge only composition, framing, pose readability, lighting, colour, focus, texture, coherence, photographic finish, and immediate visual appeal. Do not inspect, mention, or penalise anatomy; a separate process handles structural correctness. Explicit adult content is not itself a defect.\n\nAPPEAL scoring: 5 is exceptional and polished; 4 is clearly successful; 3 is adequate but noticeably imperfect; 2 is weak; 1 is poor; 0 is unusable.\n\nReturn exactly one semicolon-separated line:\nTARGET=HUMAN; APPEAL=0; AESTHETIC_ISSUES=brief concrete visual observations\n\nUse TARGET=NONHUMAN when no human figure is present. Replace the example score appropriately. Output nothing else.",384,"off",0.1,1]},{"id":1,"type":"TextBox1","pos":[-1129.8200432023268,-325.86829982772906],"size":[430,150],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"text1","name":"text1","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"text1"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"text1","name":"text1","type":"STRING","links":[1]}],"title":"TARGET DIRECTORY — change this one value","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"TextBox1"},"widgets_values":["C:\\Users\\mrtom\\AppData\\Local\\Comfy-Desktop\\ComfyUI-Shared\\output\\temp-good"]},{"id":18,"type":"TextGenerate","pos":[1200,-980],"size":[530,244],"flags":{},"order":11,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"clip","name":"clip","type":"CLIP","link":18},{"localized_name":"image","name":"image","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":19},{"localized_name":"video","name":"video","shape":7,"type":"IMAGE","link":null},{"localized_name":"audio","name":"audio","shape":7,"type":"AUDIO","link":null},{"localized_name":"prompt","name":"prompt","type":"STRING","widget":{"name":"prompt"},"link":25},{"localized_name